        "username": "rjc917",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rjc917/{size}/1888_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-02-16T17:29:19.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"cnranger\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/53a042/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> cnranger:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>rjc917 wrote:</b><br><blockquote>I was also thinking of the Miststorm universe as being like the Ultimate Marvel universe.&nbsp; Which makes me wonder if they'll do a similar thing and bring some of the more popular characters from that universe into the \"main\" universe.\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nSpecifically, Haka.\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Yep, Haka definitely qualifies.&nbsp; And then they could do team-up stuff with Aata and Arataki!</p>\n<p>Would it be weird if they dated, or would that be perfect?</p>",
